ontent": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking About Social Occasions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Social occasions are times people get together for fun. Here are some common social occasions: <br><br>dinner party - people socialize when they eat dinner <br>birthday party - a celebration of a person's birthday <br>reception - the party after a wedding <br>anniversary - a celebration of a past wedding <br>baby shower - a party before you have a baby <br>housewarming - a party when you move to a new house<br><br> You can use modals (<span class=\"strong\">can</span>, <span class=\"strong\">could</span>, <span class=\"strong\">should</span>) to make a suggestion about a social occasion. See examples in the chart:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Modals\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Suggestion\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"can\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I can invite people to my house.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"could\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We could organize a birthday party.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"should\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We should have a baby shower for Heather.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "last minute"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "organized very recently"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I know it's last minute, but we should do something! "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob09aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to organize a social event."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to socialize"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to talk to people for pleasure"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Vanessa loves to socialize. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob09aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "wedding"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a ceremony uniting two people for life"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I promised to help my sister make wedding invitations."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob09aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "It doesn't give us much time "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "We don't have many days to plan"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: That's in four days. It doesn't give us much time."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob09aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "relative"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person you are connected to by family, but not in your immediate family"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am having lunch with some relatives this afternoon."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob09aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "niece"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the daughter of your brother or sister"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm attending my niece's concert on Thursday."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob09aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "chips"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "popular snack food made from potatoes"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We could pick up some chips, soda and cake for the party. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob09aud07"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le07ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Choose a social occasion you attended, like a wedding reception or a party."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make a list of 5 - 8 details about the event. Where was it? Who attended? What happened?"}, {"type": "text", "content": " Write 5 - 8 sentences about the event."}, {"type": "text", "content": "With a partner, discuss how social occasions are different."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I identify a social occasion."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I describe the social occasion."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I compare ways to celebrate with a partner."}]}], "type": "sena"}